      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00000000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 2,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "哎呀，你……<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n你是名侦探玛琪艾儿的助手吧？\n我见过你们一起行动。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕŷ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 1,
      "offsetInSection": 256,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "54CE5440FF0C4F602026202600100001BE01000A4F60662F540D4FA663A2739B742A827E513F768452A9624B5427FF1F000A621189C18FC74F604EEC4E008D77884C52A8300200100002011401770000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 40
    },
    {
      "displayText": "不是",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 2,
      "offsetInSection": 336,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4E0D662F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 3
    },
    {
      "displayText": "算是助手吗？",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 3,
      "offsetInSection": 344,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "7B97662F52A9624B5417FF1F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 7
    },
    {
      "displayText": "不管怎样，你愿意帮帮我吗？<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕŷ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 4,
      "offsetInSection": 360,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4E0D7BA1600E6837FF0C4F60613F610F5E2E5E2E62115417FF1F00100002011401770000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 18
    },
    {
      "displayText": "我……把很重要的钥匙\n交给了我可爱的钥圈儿保管……<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕŷ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 5,
      "offsetInSection": 396,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "621120262026628A5F8891CD8981768494A55319000A4EA47ED94E86621153EF7231768494A55708513F4FDD7BA12026202600100002011401770000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 30
    },
    {
      "displayText": "但在我们一起出门的时候，\n钥圈儿它<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n好像把钥匙弄丢了……<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕŷ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 6,
      "offsetInSection": 456,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4F46572862114EEC4E008D7751FA95E8768465F65019FF0C000A94A55708513F5B8300100001BE00000A597D50CF628A94A553195F044E224E862026202600100002011401770000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 36
    },
    {
      "displayText": "有头绪吗？",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 7,
      "offsetInSection": 528,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "670959347EEA5417FF1F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 6
    },
    {
      "displayText": "去了哪里？",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 8,
      "offsetInSection": 540,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "53BB4E8654EA91CCFF1F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 6
    },
    {
      "displayText": "让我想想……那天我们好像是\n去了一家之前没去过的<U+0010><U+0002>＀<U+0006>美发沙龙<U+0010><U+0002>＀<U+0000>，<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n所以我记不太清位置在哪里了……<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕŷ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 10,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 9,
      "offsetInSection": 552,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "8BA9621160F360F32026202690A3592962114EEC597D50CF662F000A53BB4E864E005BB64E4B524D6CA153BB8FC7768400100002FF0000067F8E53D16C999F9900100002FF000000FF0C00100001BE00000A62404EE562118BB04E0D592A6E054F4D7F6E572854EA91CC4E862026202600100002011401770000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 61
    },
    {
      "displayText": "打理好发型让我感觉很开心，\n于是我就去了美发沙龙附近的<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n<U+0010><U+0002>＀<U+0006>咖啡馆<U+0010><U+0002>＀<U+0000>优雅地喝了杯茶。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕŷ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 10,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 10,
      "offsetInSection": 676,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "62537406597D53D1578B8BA96211611F89C95F885F005FC3FF0C000A4E8E662F62115C3153BB4E867F8E53D16C999F9996448FD1768400100001BE00000A00100002FF00000654965561998600100002FF0000004F1896C55730559D4E86676F8336300200100002011401770000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 55
    },
    {
      "displayText": "之后我受到邀请前往\n咖啡馆后面的<U+0010><U+0002>＀<U+0006>对战场<U+0010><U+0002>＀<U+0000>，<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n并且华丽地赢下了对战。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕŷ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 10,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 11,
      "offsetInSection": 788,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4E4B540E621153D7523090808BF7524D5F80000A549655619986540E9762768400100002FF0000065BF96218573A00100002FF000000FF0C00100001BE00000A5E764E14534E4E3D57308D624E0B4E865BF96218300200100002011401770000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 48
    },
    {
      "displayText": "如果知道一开始去的美发沙龙在哪里，\n或许也就能顺着当时的路线找了……<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕŷ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 12,
      "offsetInSection": 884,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "5982679C77E590534E005F0059CB53BB76847F8E53D16C999F99572854EA91CCFF0C000A62168BB84E5F5C3180FD987A77405F5365F676848DEF7EBF627E4E862026202600100002011401770000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 39
    },
    {
      "displayText": "那么这位助手，\n就麻烦你帮我找回钥匙了。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕŷ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 13,
      "offsetInSection": 964,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "90A34E488FD94F4D52A9624BFF0C000A5C319EBB70E64F605E2E6211627E56DE94A553194E86300200100002011401770000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 25
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+000E>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 14,
      "offsetInSection": 1016,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF000E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "弄丢钥匙的那天，\n我从美发沙龙移动到咖啡馆，<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n然后去了那后面的对战场。<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n我想当务之急是找到\n附近有咖啡馆的美发沙龙吧。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕŷ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 6,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 15,
      "offsetInSection": 1028,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "5F044E2294A55319768490A35929FF0C000A62114ECE7F8E53D16C999F9979FB52A85230549655619986FF0C00100001BE00000A7136540E53BB4E8690A3540E976276845BF96218573A300200100001BE01000A621160F35F5352A14E4B6025662F627E5230000A96448FD1670954965561998676847F8E53D16C999F995427300200100002011401770000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 70
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+0010>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 16,
      "offsetInSection": 1168,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00100000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "找到了豪华的钥匙！",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 17,
      "offsetInSection": 1180,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "627E52304E868C6A534E768494A55319FF010000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 10
    },
    {
      "displayText": "助手！我想起来了，\n我就是在这个对战场打了对战。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕŷ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 18,
      "offsetInSection": 1200,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "52A9624BFF01621160F38D7767654E86FF0C000A62115C31662F57288FD94E2A5BF96218573A62534E865BF96218300200100002011401770000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 29
    },
    {
      "displayText": "啊啊！\n那是我的钥匙！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕŷ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 19,
      "offsetInSection": 1260,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "554A554AFF01000A90A3662F6211768494A55319FF0100100002011401770000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 16
    },
    {
      "displayText": "叽叽……",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 20,
      "offsetInSection": 1292,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "53FD53FD202620260000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "我可爱的钥圈儿呀，\n该为弄丢钥匙负责的不是你，<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n而是来到这里的我。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕŷ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 21,
      "offsetInSection": 1304,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "621153EF7231768494A55708513F5440FF0C000A8BE54E3A5F044E2294A553198D1F8D2376844E0D662F4F60FF0C00100001BE00000A800C662F676552308FD991CC76846211300200100002011401770000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 41
    },
    {
      "displayText": "叽叽？",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 22,
      "offsetInSection": 1388,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "53FD53FDFF1F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 4
    },
    {
      "displayText": "不过我听说如果是钥圈儿\n喜欢的钥匙，它是绝不会放手的。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕŷ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 23,
      "offsetInSection": 1396,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4E0D8FC76211542C8BF45982679C662F94A55708513F000A559C6B22768494A55319FF0C5B83662F7EDD4E0D4F1A653E624B7684300200100002011401770000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 32
    },
    {
      "displayText": "所以呀，钥圈儿，\n今后我会把你喜欢的钥匙<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n交给你保管。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕŷ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 24,
      "offsetInSection": 1460,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "62404EE55440FF0C94A55708513FFF0C000A4ECA540E62114F1A628A4F60559C6B22768494A5531900100001BE00000A4EA47ED94F604FDD7BA1300200100002011401770000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 35
    },
    {
      "displayText": "至于其他的钥匙，\n我会负起责任拿好的。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕŷ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 25,
      "offsetInSection": 1532,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "81F34E8E51764ED6768494A55319FF0C000A62114F1A8D1F8D778D234EFB62FF597D7684300200100002011401770000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 24
    },
    {
      "displayText": "叽叽♪",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 26,
      "offsetInSection": 1580,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "53FD53FD266A0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 4
    },
    {
      "displayText": "这样一来，这份职责就可以\n由我和钥圈儿各自分担一半了！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕŷ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 27,
      "offsetInSection": 1588,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "8FD968374E006765FF0C8FD94EFD804C8D235C3153EF4EE5000A75316211548C94A55708513F540481EA520662C54E00534A4E86FF0100100002011401770000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 32
    },
    {
      "displayText": "谢谢你，助手。\n你愿意收下我的谢礼吗？<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕŷ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 28,
      "offsetInSection": 1652,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "8C228C224F60FF0C52A9624B3002000A4F60613F610F65364E0B621176848C22793C5417FF1F00100002011401770000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 24
    },
    {
      "displayText": "那么，再会了。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕŷ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 29,
